<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS $1.75 OFF - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS $1.75 OFF - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.75 lower. Trading slow. Top $56.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    56.00-56.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>	    300-310 lbs    51.00-52.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs uneven, mostly steady; 450-500 lbs scarce, 500-650 lbs 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.75-46.50</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
